        <p>A shocking fatality occurred on Monday on electrified portion of the North Eastern Railway, Backworth Junction. About 80 yards from the 1, crossing, Alice Maughan, aged 18, of Gateshead, found lying, having been in contact with a live and severely burnt on both wrists.</p>
