        <p>VERNON—TAYLOR—February 18th, at the Parish Church' Warrington, by the Rev. Canon Willis, William Vernon, to Dorothy Taylor. BALDRY—HILL—February Nth, at the Parish Church,. Warrington, by the Rev. G. A. Dearden. John Albert Baldry to Mary Hannah Hill. HARBOURNF:—GRESTY—February 23rd, at the Parish Church, Warrington, by the Rev. S. A. J. Ridpath,- Percy Harbourne to Mary Gresty. - -</p>
