        <p>MR. G. FIELD, OF LIVERPOOL His Struggle with Deaths AFTER LONG CONTINUED SUFFERING FROM BRONCHIAL ASTHMA, MR. FIELD, A WELL-KNOWN LIVERPOOL GENTLEMAN, WAS RESTORED BY VENO'S LIGHTNING COUGH CURE. To-day Veno's Lightning Congh Cure is being used by hundreds of thousands of British people. No doubt now exists as to its extraordinary curative and strengthening power. Its equal does not exist; it eclipses any other medicine for lung and chest diseases. Doctors use it themselves. Several of Eng- land's leading analysts, including W. Lascelles-Scott, Esq.. F.S. Sc. (Loud.), have given it unqualified recommendation. You can buy a 9ici. bottle and test it for yourself. If further proof of its enormous success isrequired,Mr. Field's case is a striking example. Any sufferer may interview him personally and get the facts from his own lips. His full address is 17, Desmond-street, Heyworth-street, Everton, Liverpool. A few days ago he wrote the following letter : Injustice to the astonishing merits of Veno's Lightning Cough 'Cure, I am unable to resist the temptation of relating a stubborn fact which may prove interesting to your firm. I have for the past three or four years been a martyr to some form of asthma and chronic chest affection, with spasmodic cough and expectoration, together with failing strength, in fact a general want of vital force. Even the various things prescribed by different medical men have done me little • or no good. Some little time ago my wife was passing the shop of Boots'. chemists, and hearing from a bystander that they were distlibuting 4,000 free samples of Veno's Lightning Cough Care that day, she obtained a bottle and brought it home to me. I took the contents as directed, and was surprised to find that so small a quantity benefited me so much. My good wife, in great glee, at once obtained a 2s. 9d. bottle, which I took, and am now on the second bottle, and about half through it, with the astounding result that I feel altogether a new man; my breathing is so much improved that I am able to get out and about with ease and comfort, the first time for many months • my cough has left me, and my strength s.rid energy are returning. I consider Veno's Lightning Cough Cure the best and cheapest thing any householder could have by him in case of erperg- encies. In conclusion, I solemnly affirm that I believe my life has been spared through the merits of Veno's Lightning Cough Cure. I can only, therefore, tender you my heartfelt'gratitude for the health, ease, and comfort your remedy has bestowed upon me, hoping other sufferers may have the good fortune to hear of yonr magical remedy. Again thanking you and wishing your firm every success. VENO'S LIGHTNING .COUGH CURE Stops an ordinary cough in one night, cures CHRONIC COUGHS, BRONCHITIS, ASTHMA CATARRAH, WEAK LUNGS, INFLUENZA, and CHILDREN'S COUGHS with astoaishing rapidity. It does not contain poison of any kind, is safe, prompt, and effective. The ingredients 'have never before been used in England; it stands alone, and has become the standard household remedy through- out Great Biitain. Ask for VENO'S LIGHTNING COUGH CURE, price 9id., Is. lid., and 2s. V. per bottle, at chemists and medicine vendors everywhere.</p>
